## Docker Environment

This application is dockerised and currently running. The `/application` directory contains all Laravel project files.

### Running Commands

Use the `make` helper to run artisan commands:

```bash
make artisan COMMAND="make:model Test -mf"
```

Or execute commands directly in the container:

```bash
docker exec cardanomercury-web bash -c "your command here"
```

### Common Make Commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `make frontend-build` | Rebuild frontend assets |
| `make frontend-watch` | Run Vite in watch/hot-reload mode |
| `make db-migrate` | Run database migrations |
| `make db-refresh` | Fresh migration with seeds |
| `make shell` | Interactive shell in web container |
| `make artisan COMMAND="..."` | Run any artisan command |

### Running Tests

```bash
make artisan COMMAND="test"
make artisan COMMAND="test tests/Feature/ExampleTest.php"
make artisan COMMAND="test --filter=testName"
```

### Running Pint

```bash
docker exec cardanomercury-web bash -c "vendor/bin/pint --dirty"
```

